      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.31,
          "end": 6.51,
          "en": "-: So were you successful using our recipes array here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 6.51,
          "end": 9.33,
          "en": "and replicating this part in the code as often",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 9.33,
          "end": 13.74,
          "en": "as needed and fill it with the data for the recipe?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 13.74,
          "end": 18.74,
          "en": "Now clearly we need NG four for this, so let's add NG four.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 19.17,
          "end": 20.94,
          "en": "This is the directive which allows us",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 20.94,
          "end": 24.12,
          "en": "to repeat code in our template.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 24.12,
          "end": 27.21,
          "en": "And here I want to loop through all the recipes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 27.21,
          "end": 31.26,
          "en": "So I will actually create a local variable named recipe.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 31.26,
          "end": 33.33,
          "en": "This name is totally up to you",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 33.33,
          "end": 36.69,
          "en": "that will simply store the recipe off each iteration",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 36.69,
          "end": 40.013,
          "en": "in our loop and I will loop through all the recipes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 40.013,
          "end": 43.65,
          "en": "So through this recipes property we created here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 43.65,
          "end": 45.411,
          "en": "in the TypeScript file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 45.411,
          "end": 48.99,
          "en": "Now with that, I'll also bring this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 48.99,
          "end": 52.02,
          "en": "into new lines here to make it a bit easier to read.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 52.02,
          "end": 56.25,
          "en": "With that, everywhere inside this NG four loop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 56.25,
          "end": 60.45,
          "en": "so everywhere here, we can use this recipe now.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 60.45,
          "end": 62.61,
          "en": "So let's use it to output the name.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 62.61,
          "end": 65.13,
          "en": "We can use string interpolation for that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 65.13,
          "end": 66.93,
          "en": "String Interpolation, as you learned allows us",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 66.93,
          "end": 69.816,
          "en": "to output some text anywhere in our template.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 69.816,
          "end": 73.32,
          "en": "Now we got this single recipe, but that's going",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 73.32,
          "end": 75.87,
          "en": "to be an object looking like our model,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 75.87,
          "end": 79.38,
          "en": "because remember the recipes array simply holds an array",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 79.38,
          "end": 81.06,
          "en": "of our recipes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 81.06,
          "end": 83.52,
          "en": "So a single item simply looks like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 83.52,
          "end": 86.435,
          "en": "It has a name, a description, anti-image path.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 86.435,
          "end": 89.16,
          "en": "Well, with this information we can",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 89.16,
          "end": 92.152,
          "en": "of course access the name here like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 92.152,
          "end": 94.08,
          "en": "And for the description",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 94.08,
          "end": 97.28999999999999,
          "en": "we can replace this with recipe description.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 97.28999999999999,
          "end": 99.36,
          "en": "So we're going to use the property names",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 99.36,
          "end": 101.75999999999999,
          "en": "we set up here in the model and port.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 101.75999999999999,
          "end": 102.84,
          "en": "You have to use the ones here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 102.84,
          "end": 105,
          "en": "at the top of course, because down there",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 105,
          "end": 107.88,
          "en": "these are only the constructor argument names.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 107.88,
          "end": 110.60499999999999,
          "en": "They are not available outside of this model.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 110.60499999999999,
          "end": 113.417,
          "en": "So that's the name and description.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 113.417,
          "end": 116.22,
          "en": "Now about that image.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 116.22,
          "end": 119.693,
          "en": "First of all, for that alt text here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 119.693,
          "end": 122.4,
          "en": "that's a normal HTML attribute, of course.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 122.4,
          "end": 125.7,
          "en": "I will use string interpolation to output some text here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 125.7,
          "end": 127.437,
          "en": "The recipe name maybe.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 127.437,
          "end": 131.25,
          "en": "But regarding the image source itself,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 131.25,
          "end": 133.11,
          "en": "and I'm just splitting this over multiple lines",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 133.11,
          "end": 135.33,
          "en": "to make it a bit easier to read.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 135.33,
          "end": 139.128,
          "en": "Regarding that source we can follow two approaches.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 139.128,
          "end": 143.139,
          "en": "You can either use string interpolation here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 143.139,
          "end": 147.848,
          "en": "to output recipe image path here, and that should work fine.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 147.848,
          "end": 152.333,
          "en": "Or as an alternative, you cannot use the attribute",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 152.333,
          "end": 156.40800000000002,
          "en": "plus string interpolation, but you could bind",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 156.40800000000002,
          "end": 159.523,
          "en": "to the source property itself.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 159.523,
          "end": 162.66,
          "en": "And now here you don't add curly braces",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 162.66,
          "end": 165.93,
          "en": "instead just recipe image path",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 165.93,
          "end": 167.82,
          "en": "because now we're using property binding",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 167.82,
          "end": 170.04,
          "en": "and not string interpolation anymore.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 170.04,
          "end": 173.645,
          "en": "So here is a great example of where you may use both",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 173.645,
          "end": 178.41,
          "en": "string interpolation with the normal HTML attribute,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 178.41,
          "end": 181.47,
          "en": "or not using the attribute, but directly binding",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 181.47,
          "end": 184.68,
          "en": "to the source property of the image, and then just putting",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 184.68,
          "end": 188.25,
          "en": "in a valid expression, returning what this property expects",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 188.25,
          "end": 191.475,
          "en": "in this case, a string between quotation marks.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 191.475,
          "end": 194.36,
          "en": "Now I will go with the property binding approach here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 194.36,
          "end": 196.92000000000002,
          "en": "and since I can't comment this out in here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 196.92000000000002,
          "end": 199.8,
          "en": "without breaking the element, I'm going to remove it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 199.8,
          "end": 200.633,
          "en": "But I want you to keep",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 200.633,
          "end": 203.013,
          "en": "in mind that both approaches would work.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 204,
          "end": 207.096,
          "en": "With that, let's save and see if we see something.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 207.096,
          "end": 210.058,
          "en": "And actually that looks pretty good, but looks",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 210.058,
          "end": 214.5,
          "en": "like the image I chose does not support deep linking",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 214.5,
          "end": 216.69,
          "en": "so that's nice.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 216.69,
          "end": 218.28,
          "en": "Probably good for them.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 218.28,
          "end": 221.04,
          "en": "Let me quickly pick a different image then.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 221.04,
          "end": 224.76,
          "en": "So I ended up with picking this image here then",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 224.76,
          "end": 226.50900000000001,
          "en": "so you can see it here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 226.50900000000001,
          "end": 229.151,
          "en": "And now we got the list working.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 229.151,
          "end": 230.667,
          "en": "This is the style I want to have.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 230.667,
          "end": 232.17000000000002,
          "en": "Of course it doesn't do anything if I click it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 232.17000000000002,
          "end": 234.21,
          "en": "but that's something we can add in the future.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 234.21,
          "end": 238.072,
          "en": "For now the recipe list component is taking shape.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 238.072,
          "end": 241.08,
          "en": "I want to add one more thing though.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 241.08,
          "end": 243.57,
          "en": "I don't want to have this button set directly",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 243.57,
          "end": 245.002,
          "en": "on top of this list.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 245.002,
          "end": 248.31,
          "en": "So what I'll quickly do in my recipe list component here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 248.31,
          "end": 251.16,
          "en": "between the button and the list,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 251.16,
          "end": 253.47,
          "en": "I can simply add a horizontal line",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 253.47,
          "end": 257.04,
          "en": "to have a little bit of a well spacing in between",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 257.04,
          "end": 258.509,
          "en": "and a nice separation.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 258.509,
          "end": 259.98,
          "en": "So that's the list.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 259.98,
          "end": 262.23,
          "en": "And you should see that if you add more items",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 262.23,
          "end": 265.14,
          "en": "to that list that it automatically grows.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 265.14,
          "end": 267.873,
          "en": "So if I simply duplicate this because I'm lazy,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
